    "updated_at": "2026-03-05T15:27:00Z",
    "body": "I don't want to change document.customElementRegistry being the source of truth, but I think the loaded page should inherit registry from initial about:blank.\nIt is, IMO, rather surprising that both documents get their own registries.\nThat breaks window.open() case, if one registers custom element definitions before the page load.",
